{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"平\",\n    \"core\": \"X\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：Y 的大块对每屏的心理变化、发生原因和前后关系交代得更完整，跨屏推进也更明确；small：两版小字都有具体补充，也都有少量重复或偏向音乐描写的内容，整体难分高下。core：X 始终围绕亲密中的幸福、想靠近的渴望和害怕失去的痛楚展开，Y 后半段则明显转向记忆真伪、自我责备和自我接纳，核心有所偏移；concise：Y 对幸福是否真实、是否珍惜、是否应该自责等问题反复解释，概念性复述更多。human：X 的「怕对方觉得负担太重」「会嫌自己太黏」「等真的到了那时再说」等表达更符合日常说话习惯，Y 的「重新进入他的意识」「没有把回忆延伸成对现在的期待」「低沉而专注的自我审视」等有明显的书面摘要腔和抽象名词堆叠；fine：X 对话到嘴边的犹豫、亲近后的鼻酸、害怕被嫌弃的空落感等描写更贴近具体的人际体验；load：X 的大字强调词短而集中，Y 多个较长的大块连续出现，尤其后半段每屏有四五块大字，扫读负担更重。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "576e78db-b068-4c97-b261-0f5c082e073e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T072801420987Z", "elapsed_seconds": 315.343, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T07:33:16.776190+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c217631a4068afe8ae6c76efa2c5e5bcd651e3d793d0c548d7fcecf03dedafba", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py